1
00:00:00,456 --> 00:00:02,126
(Sheldon:)Very well.

2
00:00:02,876 --> 00:00:04,796
(Sheldon:)Enjoy yourself.

3
00:00:04,961 --> 00:00:08,461
You're gonna be in the presence of
something I've dreamed of for decades.

4
00:00:09,799 --> 00:00:11,379
I hope you'll appreciate...

5
00:00:11,593 --> 00:00:14,633
(Sheldon:)...the magnitude of where you are,
and what it represents.

6
00:00:17,807 --> 00:00:19,187
(Penny:)I'll talk to Leonard.

7
00:00:20,894 --> 00:00:23,064
(Sheldon:)-You will?
-Yes.

8
00:00:23,229 --> 00:00:25,979
(Penny:)If it means that much to you,
you should go.

9
00:00:26,482 --> 00:00:29,692
(Sheldon(Hugging her):)Oh, Penny, thank you.

10
00:00:31,487 --> 00:00:33,987
(Penny:)-You're welcome.
-Since I rarely hug...

11
00:00:34,157 --> 00:00:37,367
(Sheldon:)...I'm relying on your expertise
regarding duration.

12
00:00:38,202 --> 00:00:40,622
(Penny:)-I think we're there.
-Oh, good.

13
00:00:41,623 --> 00:00:42,703
(Howard(on the phone):)Bye-bye.

14
00:00:47,045 --> 00:00:51,345
(Raj:)Even though I don't have a girlfriend, I
can still have a good time on Valentine's.

15
00:00:51,507 --> 00:00:53,887
(Howard:)Trust me, you can't. I've tried.

16
00:00:54,427 --> 00:00:56,767
(Raj:)No, no, no.
I'm gonna have a "me" day.

17
00:00:56,930 --> 00:00:59,510
I'm gonna go
to one of those spas in Koreatown...

18
00:00:59,682 --> 00:01:01,222
...take a steam, get a massage.

